        dat("THE PARAMETER the_kings_condition ('when you come and say' — the appointment conditional on the people's asking; the disgrace / the commandment two arms; NO KING ON THE TAPE until Samuel's day — the Prophets' tape the run's future case); the exam's person the people who ask a king in Samuel's days — accepted against by R. Nehorai's arm, too soon by R. Judah's")
        return out("the disgrace and the commandment (17:14) — R. Nehorai's disgrace by 1 Samuel 8:7, R. Judah's commandment punished for its timing (the Sifrei 156:4-6): two arms a DATA row; the condition 'when you come and say' a parameter — no king on the tape; the people who ask in Samuel's days accepted against", ['accepted'])
