        dat("THE WRITE levite_service_at_the_place_permitted — a STATUS on israel_people at the chapters' own day (DI2); THE PARAMETER the_watches_equality (the festival's own offerings, at the three feasts, when Israel is gathered in one gate); the exam's person the priest of another watch who blesses at the festival — accepted")
        return out("all the desire of his soul (18:6) — the blessing at another watch; the watches equal only in the festival's own offerings, 'one of your gates' one gate for all Israel at the three feasts (the Sifrei 168:3-4; korach's watches by CALL): THE WRITE levite_service_at_the_place_permitted, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day; the priest of another watch who blesses at the festival accepted", ['levite_service_at_the_place_permitted'])
